    "body": "The continuing failure was not the campsite cleanup. The new log showed that cleanup completed, but the carried-mask feature then wrote Rockstar's shared clothing cache from an address that was one slot late. That startup write corrupted the inventory/clothing state used by shop presentation. I removed every direct cache and refresh-flag write; the mask now uses only Rockstar inventory natives. Restart the game, then test one general store, one station clerk, and one newspaper seller. Their full-map and minimap icons must remain available, and RMB must show the normal shop interaction.",
